        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands and musical acts: Starsailor, White Town\n- People: James Walsh, Ben Byrne, James Stelfox, Barry Westhead, Jyoti Prakash Mishra\n- Songs and EPs: \"In the Crossfire\", Abort, Retry, Fail?\n- Topics: Iraq War\n\nFacts:\n- In 1996, White Town released the EP Abort, Retry, Fail?.\n- White Town is a British musical act and the solo project of Jyoti Prakash Mishra.\n- In 2000, Starsailor was formed as an English post-Britpop band.\n- Since its formation, Starsailor has included James Walsh as guitarist and vocalist, Ben Byrne as drummer, James Stelfox as bassist, and Barry Westhead as keyboardist.\n- \"In the Crossfire\" is a rock song written by Starsailor.\n- \"In the Crossfire\" is about the suffering of people who have lived through the Iraq War.",
